      "source": "The scope of a library. The common <a href=\"#COMPILE\"><code>COMPILE</code></a>, <a href=\"#RUNTIME\"><code>RUNTIME</code></a> and\n<a href=\"#PROVIDED\"><code>PROVIDED</code></a> scopes are defined here and supported by the common <a href=\"Layouts.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.loader.tools\"><code>Layouts</code></a>.\nA custom <a href=\"Layout.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.loader.tools\"><code>Layout</code></a> can handle additional scopes as required.",
      "translation": "库的作用域。常见的 <code>COMPILE</code>、<code>RUNTIME</code> 和 <code>PROVIDED</code> 作用域在此定义，并由通用的 <a href=\"Layouts.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.boot.loader.tools\"><code>Layouts</code></a> 支持。自定义的 <a href=\"Layout.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.loader.tools\"><code>Layout</code></a> 可根据需要处理额外的作用域。",
      "count": 2
    },
